   "id": "ED_008001:0x10e8",
   "off": 4328,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "龍馬があやうく\\n暗殺されかけた\\n丁度その頃",
   "en": "Right around\\nthe time Ryoma\\nwas nearly\\nassassinated...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x5925"
  },
  {
   "id": "ED_008001:0x1460",
   "off": 5216,
   "max": 68,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "居酒屋で飲んでいた\\n暗黒桜桃隊たちは\\n店を出て\\n夜風に吹かれていた",
   "en": "The Dark\\nCherries, who had\\nbeen drinking at\\na tavern, stepped\\noutside into the\\nnight breeze.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x5926"
  },
  {
   "id": "ED_008001:0x19a4",
   "off": 6564,
   "max": 68,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "あー飲んだ飲んだ\\nやっぱりアンタたちと\\n一緒にいるのが最高だわ！",
   "en": "Ahh, that was\\nsome good\\ndrinkin'! Hangin'\\nout with you two\\nreally is the best!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x5927"
  },
  {
   "id": "ED_008001:0x208c",
   "off": 8332,
   "max": 52,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "当然です……\\n私はいつだって\\n姐さんと一緒よ……",
   "en": "Naturally...\\nI'm always\\nwith you, Sis...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x5928"
  },
  {
   "id": "ED_008001:0x2760",
   "off": 10080,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
